WEBVTT

00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:08.390
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:14.890
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:16.730
It's my day!

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:27.310
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:34.710
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:42.090
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:49.490
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:55.270
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.770 --> 00:01:02.410
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.570 --> 00:01:09.910
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:16.050
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:19.120
I just want to walk

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:22.660
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:26.630
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:35.540
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:41.980
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:44.250
It's my day!

00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:54.620
<i>I...</i>

00:01:56.490 --> 00:01:58.330
<i>I kissed Domyoji?!</i>

00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:02.050
What... well, what do you know?

00:02:02.050 --> 00:02:04.470
I thought I felt someone
sucking my face. It was you!

00:02:05.030 --> 00:02:06.630
You nearly chipped my teeth!

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:16.190
Tsukushi! Don't tell me
you actually kissed...

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:18.110
Stop right there! Don't say it!

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:35.860
"Atami Night Love"

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:45.510
My very first kiss...

00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:54.450
Don't tell me... you never 
kissed anyone before?

00:03:03.190 --> 00:03:06.930
You're a lucky girl,
to have me for your first kiss.

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:08.560
You should be thankful.

00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:13.920
But you need to work on your style.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:16.030
That was a little too aggressive.

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:18.810
Stay away from me!

00:03:24.910 --> 00:03:26.580
Are you... crying?

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:28.910
Hey! Wait!

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:31.850
<i>I'm cursed.</i>

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:45.710
<i>I got all dressed up...</i>

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:48.640
<i>...and I tried to be something
I'm not.</i>

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:58.110
<i>Cinderella for a night.</i>

00:04:00.980 --> 00:04:02.810
<i>Cinderella for a night.</i>

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:09.920
<i>Stupid! I'm so stupid!</i>

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:23.830
We're back!

00:04:24.470 --> 00:04:26.320
My, what a stunning dress!

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:30.710
I bet you made their eyes pop out!

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:34.310
I'm going to bed.

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:36.910
Tsukushi...

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:50.080
<i>It was my very first kiss.
I wanted it to be with someone I loved...</i>

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:04.040
<i>A kiss is no big deal...</i>

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:09.810
<i>It was just a kiss... no big deal...</i>

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:25.330
<i>Just a kiss... no big deal...</i>

00:05:27.900 --> 00:05:30.130
<i>Just a kiss...</i>

00:05:51.650 --> 00:05:53.320
They must be shooting
a film over there!

00:05:55.020 --> 00:05:57.390
There's a sexy babe with them, too!

00:05:58.490 --> 00:06:01.740
It's not exactly Miami Beach, is it?

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:07.230
Take a picture, it'll last longer! Trash!

00:06:07.530 --> 00:06:10.080
This is why I didn't want to come here!

00:06:10.940 --> 00:06:15.060
The water's not that nice emerald green...
you can't breathe the air...

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:17.240
...and the place is
full of rugrats and old farts!

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:20.630
Mom? Where are we going?

00:06:20.630 --> 00:06:23.370
To sit near the Eitoku kids!
Where else?

00:06:23.370 --> 00:06:25.040
What?! No! No way!

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:28.890
I know why she doesn't want
to see Tsukasa Domyoji!

00:06:29.350 --> 00:06:31.440
It's because... because...

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:34.190
...because he forced Tsukushi
to kiss him!

00:06:35.090 --> 00:06:36.060
Kazuya!

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:37.840
K-kiss?!

00:06:41.070 --> 00:06:42.670
Great job, Tsukushi!

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:45.110
Get him to follow-up right!

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:47.340
<i>Oh, for heaven's sake...</i>

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:49.040
Just drop it, will you?!

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:53.210
Tsukushi!

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:05.740
Hi.

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:09.890
<i>Jeez, why am I turning beet red?!</i>

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:12.740
Have you noticed you're
staring at each other?

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:18.170
These two kissed last night.
I saw 'em.

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:21.270
You've gotta be kidding, Nishikado!

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:24.410
He's kidding! Right, Domyoji?

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:33.420
I couldn't stop her.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:35.280
She came up and jumped on me!

00:07:35.650 --> 00:07:36.740
I didn't have any choice!

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:39.520
I knew it! What a little hick!

00:07:40.090 --> 00:07:42.790
She took advantage of 
the chaos to attack him!

00:07:42.790 --> 00:07:43.740
What a creep!

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:02.010
That's not what happened!

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:03.180
It was an accident!

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:06.950
I tripped and Domyoji was there and...

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:09.420
What are you telling me for?

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:11.850
I don't care who you kiss.

00:08:11.850 --> 00:08:13.250
It makes no difference to me.

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:20.980
Look at her expression!

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:21.740
Classic!

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:46.620
<i>I'm such an idiot!</i>

00:08:50.120 --> 00:08:52.760
<i>Thinking Rui Hanazawa
would help me again!</i>

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:19.790
Hey! You!

00:09:20.690 --> 00:09:21.120
Huh?

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:25.410
You hurt Tsukushi!
Embarrassed her in front of everyone!

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:27.810
Now I'm gonna have to
take you down!

00:10:03.190 --> 00:10:04.840
<i>I have to forget
it ever happened...</i>

00:10:20.940 --> 00:10:23.210
<i>Now, which room was Shizuka's?</i>

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:25.940
<i>I'll just slip in and leave this...</i>

00:10:38.260 --> 00:10:39.280
I'm so sorry!

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:41.980
<i>Oh, my gosh!</i>

00:10:53.510 --> 00:10:56.480
<i>What's going on here?!</i>

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:11.390
There she is... Shizu...

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:14.330
You're disappointed, aren't you?

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:16.500
About what?

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:21.040
That Makino isn't here tonight.

00:11:23.170 --> 00:11:26.110
Why do you keep bringing her up?

00:11:27.380 --> 00:11:30.210
Because you like her, don't you?

00:11:31.410 --> 00:11:35.310
I figured that out when you 
rescued her in the cafeteria.

00:11:39.190 --> 00:11:40.630
I was a bit jealous.

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:42.990
Your heart doesn't
only belong to me, does it?

00:11:43.620 --> 00:11:45.540
What would you think if I did?

00:11:45.990 --> 00:11:48.730
I'd think you two
made a good couple.

00:11:55.570 --> 00:11:57.810
What's so funny, Rui?

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:04.950
That's a low shot.
Don't say it if you don't mean it.

00:12:05.350 --> 00:12:09.450
You play with people's feelings,
then smile as if it's all a game...

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:13.890
...and disappear when people get hurt.

00:12:15.590 --> 00:12:17.990
Rui... that's not what I meant...

00:12:19.230 --> 00:12:21.430
You're toying with me! Stop it!

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:26.070
You think I care about
Tsukushi Makino? Get real.

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:28.610
The one I want to have
in my arms is...

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:31.840
Rui!

00:12:33.170 --> 00:12:35.640
Rui, what's wrong 
with you?! Let me go!

00:13:10.780 --> 00:13:11.780
Look! I got another one!

00:13:12.380 --> 00:13:15.420
Pretty cool, huh?
That's ten squid to zip!

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:18.850
Squid? You mean squids. 
What are you, stupid?

00:13:19.350 --> 00:13:21.470
It's plural, so you add an s.

00:13:21.470 --> 00:13:24.620
You're so dumb. 
You don't add an "s" to "squid."

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:29.810
You don't even know that? 
I'm winning this, easy.

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:34.670
Shut up, <i>Nouveau Riche!</i> 
It's not over yet!

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:39.810
It's a big one! Takes a 
man to catch 'em that big.

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:41.540
In your face!

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:54.780
Stop laughing!

00:14:03.990 --> 00:14:09.900
That's nothing compared to the pain
you put Tsukushi through!

00:14:11.270 --> 00:14:13.070
You know her real well, huh?

00:14:14.100 --> 00:14:15.070
I do!

00:14:16.740 --> 00:14:19.110
We've been friends since grade school.

00:14:20.810 --> 00:14:26.920
The Tsukushi I knew was no outcast!

00:14:33.620 --> 00:14:39.260
She's cheerful, and nice, 
and kind to everyone.

00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:43.000
She was always surrounded by friends.

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:46.700
And now look what you... you...!

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:49.930
Huh! Sounds like you're in love.

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:51.410
Well, no accounting for taste.

00:14:53.510 --> 00:14:58.040
Sorry to disappoint you,
but she loves me.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:14:59.040
That's a lie!

00:14:59.850 --> 00:15:04.320
I don't think so. The proof is in
that kiss she gave me last night.

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:08.790
It's a shame I have no interest
in that poor backwater hick...

00:15:10.020 --> 00:15:13.740
...but boy,
I remember those soft lips...

00:15:13.740 --> 00:15:17.040
...as she pressed against me,
pulling me close...

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:20.600
Liar! Tsukushi wouldn't do that!

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:24.120
Liar! Liar!

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:26.570
Stupid idiot! Moron!

00:15:27.470 --> 00:15:28.870
Hey, that hurts, you jerk!

00:15:28.870 --> 00:15:32.080
Liar! Liar!
It's a lie! It's a lie!

00:15:33.940 --> 00:15:35.950
Tsukushi!

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:54.770
<i>You think I care about
Tsukushi Makino? Get real.</i>

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:58.140
<i>The only one I want to
have in my arms is...</i>

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:09.950
<i>I have no interest in other people...</i>

00:16:13.390 --> 00:16:14.050
<i>Strange girl...</i>

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:31.740
<i>Each time I'd open the door to the emergency staircase, 
my heart would pound...</i>

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:36.410
<i>It was like going to see
my one precious treasure...</i>

00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:49.620
<i>Rui Hanazawa...</i>

00:17:17.480 --> 00:17:18.280
Tsukushi?

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:21.440
What are you doing here?

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:27.440
Kazuya? Nothing much.
What about you?

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:28.860
Hi, Makino.

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:31.430
Take a look at all the squid
we caught!

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:33.680
Squid? You caught them together?

00:17:33.680 --> 00:17:34.680
Well, yeah...

00:17:34.680 --> 00:17:36.730
Look at how many!
They're all mine!

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:39.050
This guy can only catch octopi!

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:39.840
Quiet, you!

00:17:41.670 --> 00:17:44.340
Wow... how many squids are there?

00:17:49.110 --> 00:17:52.010
You're so dumb. 
The plural is "squid."

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:54.850
You didn't know that either!

00:17:55.640 --> 00:17:56.160
Shut up!

00:17:56.160 --> 00:17:56.890
Make me!

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:10.530
I'm so glad...

00:18:11.530 --> 00:18:13.680
On a night like this, 
I'm not alone...

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:35.220
Rui? What's wrong?

00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:39.480
How can you be so calm...

00:18:39.480 --> 00:18:42.230
...when I grabbed you
and dragged you in here?

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:47.500
Rui...

00:18:55.740 --> 00:18:59.950
Rui, it's all right with me.
I'm happy about it.

00:19:00.580 --> 00:19:03.720
That you would need me so badly...

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:07.490
I'd nearly forgotten 
that you were a man.

00:19:08.420 --> 00:19:10.810
No! I don't just want your body!

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:15.490
Don't be afraid.
We are a man and a woman...

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:19.300
And this is completely natural...

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:22.840
Shizuka... I...

00:19:24.840 --> 00:19:25.440
Don't talk...

00:19:32.510 --> 00:19:35.180
Hey, everybody, up on deck!!
It's squid-eatin' time!

00:19:36.180 --> 00:19:36.650
Wha?

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:40.920
You gotta be kidding...

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:48.460
What's the deal, Tsukasa?!

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:50.330
Are you crazy?

00:19:50.800 --> 00:19:53.300
Come on! Eat up!
I caught them myself.

00:19:53.300 --> 00:19:54.830
No, I caught them!

00:20:00.240 --> 00:20:02.540
That looks good.
Can I have some?

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:04.470
I'll get you one.

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:06.510
That's okay,
I'll just have some of yours...

00:20:12.450 --> 00:20:13.650
Where's Shizuka?

00:20:14.890 --> 00:20:16.720
Who knows? Sleeping, I guess.

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:19.590
It's a shame that you were
interrupted...

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:21.910
<i>What am I saying?!</i>

00:20:22.960 --> 00:20:23.910
Were you listening?

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:26.060
No! Not really!
I mean, I didn't mean to!

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:28.870
I was passing by and I just... I just...

00:20:29.270 --> 00:20:31.400
Oh, I got smoke in my eyes...

00:20:32.570 --> 00:20:34.000
I'll never understand women.

00:20:35.100 --> 00:20:37.810
They're so stubborn, 
and think only of themselves.

00:20:50.750 --> 00:20:52.490
<i>Don't hate me!</i>

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:58.190
<i>We're the emergency stairway friends!</i>

00:20:59.030 --> 00:21:01.200
<i>Or maybe that was 
all in my head...</i>

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:07.510
<i>If I hated you,
would I have helped you?</i>

00:21:13.170 --> 00:21:14.710
Here, somebody,
give this to Rui.

00:21:15.110 --> 00:21:16.640
Give it to him yourself!

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:19.810
Bury the hatchet already,
good grief!

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:24.540
Rui, I really don't want
to give this to you, but eat it.

00:21:24.850 --> 00:21:26.150
Nice cover.

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:28.290
I've never had them like this before!

00:21:28.790 --> 00:21:29.720
They're pretty good.

00:21:30.090 --> 00:21:32.360
You bet! It's 'cause I caught 'em!

00:21:32.360 --> 00:21:34.100
I caught 'em!

00:21:40.170 --> 00:21:44.710
<i>Tonight, the guy who saved me 
was that guy I can't stand.</i>

00:21:47.170 --> 00:21:48.380
<i>Thank you, Domyoji!</i>

00:21:48.880 --> 00:21:51.180
<i>But that doesn't mean 
I like you any better!</i>

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:52.510
Whuh?

00:22:05.630 --> 00:22:11.700
You let your hair down a little

00:22:13.670 --> 00:22:19.570
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:29.450
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:29.680 --> 00:22:37.490
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:37.490 --> 00:22:45.260
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:45.530 --> 00:22:53.400
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:45.530 --> 00:22:53.400
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:53.400 --> 00:23:01.780
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:53.400 --> 00:23:01.780
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:03.580 --> 00:23:11.560
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:11.560 --> 00:23:19.330
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:19.600 --> 00:23:27.500
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:19.600 --> 00:23:27.500
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:27.500 --> 00:23:35.910
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:27.500 --> 00:23:35.910
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:46.420 --> 00:23:50.630
Summer's over! Back to school...
and to bullying and torment.

00:23:51.390 --> 00:23:56.400
And those moments
on the emergency staircase...

00:23:56.700 --> 00:24:02.340
...my refuge, where Rui Hanazawa
would smile kindly at me...

00:24:03.070 --> 00:24:04.710
I thought that would go on forever.

00:24:06.240 --> 00:24:07.380
Next on Hana Yori Dango:

00:24:07.480 --> 00:24:08.810
"The Nightmare of the New Term!!"
